<title>JAPAN: Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</title>
<headline>Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mikuni and Co Ltd said on Friday it had assigned the following preliminary ratings to planned bond issues:</p>
<p>-AA-</p>
<p>Shikoku Electric Power Co Inc., 10 billion yen mortgaged due 2000</p>
<p>-BBB-</p>
<p>Skylark Co Ltd, 10 billion yen  unsecured due 2004  </p>
<p>-B-</p>
<p>Nippon Paper Industries Co Ltd,</p>
<p>25 billion yen unsecured due 2003</p>
<p>25 billion yen unsecured due 2005</p>
<p>-CCC-</p>
<p>Kobe Electric Railway Co Ltd,</p>
<p>3.5 billion yen unsecured convertible due 2001, private placement</p>
<p>8 billion yen unsecured convertible due 2004</p>
<p>Shinko Kosan Ltd, 3 billion yen unsecured due 2004</p>
</text>
